      "id": "claim_0489e0c38b0c4853bac7efbb2bfd4b3d",
      "statement": "renderCodeView's onRun handler runs a strict gate order before any execution: reassemble source, then validateLocked(source, segments) (refuses with a locked-code error + Reset on failure), then validateImports(source, kata.allowedImports) (refuses by listing ImportViolation[] and recording an incorrect attempt on failure); only if both pass does it disable Run, enable Stop, and call runJava. Any failure refuses the run with no iframe or network activity.",
